## Colour palettes (src/presets/palettes.ts)

The background/text/accent colour values of the 23 built-in palettes are ported
from:

  ParthJadhav/app-store-screenshots
  https://github.com/ParthJadhav/app-store-screenshots
  MIT License, Copyright (c) Parth Jadhav

The marker-band ("highlight") colours are not from that project — they are
computed here from the ported accent and background colours, tinted until the
palette's own text colour reaches WCAG 2 AA contrast against the band (see
below).

## Contrast formula (src/lib/contrast.ts)

`relativeLuminance` and `contrastRatio` implement the public WCAG 2.1 relative
luminance and contrast ratio formulas (W3C, https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/,
sections 1.4.3 and Appendix A). These are open specification formulas, not
third-party code, and are included here for completeness alongside the
palette attribution above.
